                <li>Keeping our little homelab alive like a mad scientist!</li>
                <li>The fall weather! 🍂</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="now-section">
            <h2>Doing 🤔</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Live streaming gameplay and more over on <a href="https://twitch.tv/jiggyflyjoe" target="_blank">my Twitch channel</a>. I may be crazy, but I love sharing my love for gaming!</li>
