            <ul>
                <li>The final season of <em>Star Trek: The Next Generation</em> for my big rewatch and review project over on <a href="https://blog.jiggyflyjoe.com" target="_blank">my blog</a>! I'm doing <em>the entire franchise</em>, so if you're interested in reading those, feel free to check out and subscribe to said blog! (No worries, it's free!)</li>
